<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Can't outrun your fate</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œMy name is Adora Grayskull, and Iâ€™d like to be the next Senator from the great State of New York!â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Itâ€™s 2022, and Congresswoman Adora Grayskull runs for the Senate of the United States. With her campaign manager and best friend Glimmer at her side and a bright future ahead, there's nothing stopping her. But when she meets a beautiful stranger on election night, both their paths, as well as the path of humankind, deviates from everything that has been planned for her. Destiny keeps the woman away from her, but: can Adora outrun her fate?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;OR: Drama, destiny, high politics, romance, fate &amp;amp; a conspiracy from high above? Canâ€™t get any better.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>21st_tikonda</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Drama</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Drama &amp; Romance</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Destiny</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fate</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fate &amp; Destiny</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Politics</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>High Politics</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Real World</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Conspiracy</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>catradora</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>New York City</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I mean I will literally show you real places in real New York because it's fun</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>POV Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>It's always autumn here</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Canon Lesbian Relationship</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fate keeps pulling Catra away</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora's fate is determined</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>But since when has Adora ever listened to anyone?</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Castaspella (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Netossa (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Entrapta (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mermista (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sea Hawk (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>The Chairman</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>And who the fuck is the chairman?</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Strangers to Lovers</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>But it looks like they aren't allowed to be in a relationship</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>We will race New York</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hurt/Comfort</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hurt/Comfort in a loop</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Oh boi I'm going to play with your hearts</rdf:li>
